      "text": "# BioIntel Literature Notes\n\n## Background\nPTGS2 is associated with inflammatory pathways. ADORA2A is a G protein-coupled receptor and is often discussed with caffeine and adenosine.\n\n## Demonstration findings\n- Aspirin reference: PTGS2 IC50 125 nM\n- Caffeine reference: ADORA2A Ki 820 nM\n- Adenosine reference: ADORA2A Ki 32 nM\n- Quercetin reference: PIK3CA IC50 950 nM\n\n## Warning\nThese are illustrative values for software demonstration only.\n"
